            "content": "<p>Brisa started with one friend trying to help another upgrade his life.<br/>Everything was improving, except he couldn\u2019t quit vaping.<br/>So we built something for him.</p><p>Brisa has always come from a good heart. <br/>We know it\u2019s hard.<br/>We know why it\u2019s hard. <br/>Our mission is simple: make the switch feel easier, and make life better.</p><p>We\u2019re here to bring products that genuinely improve people\u2019s lives, with authenticity at the forefront and real products without the gimmicks.\u00a0</p>",
