    "faq_jptxLw": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_prcTJn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does Brisa actually work?",
            "answer": "<p>Brisa is made for the moment you'd usually reach for a vape. It gives you a non-consumable object to reach for instead, with the same weight and a familiar draw, and no nicotine, smoke, or vapour.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_jDRjKb": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Brisa drug - free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Brisa contains no nicotine, no tobacco, no cannabis, no caffeine, and no medicinal substances.</p><p>It is not a vape, cigarette, or drug product. It is more the opposite. Brisa was built as a tool to help people move away from those habits by giving them something familiar to use without smoke, vapour, or nicotine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_iDWdDH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's in the core?",
            "answer": "<p>Brisa cores are made with internal fibre material infused with food-grade aromatic compounds.</p><p>The cores are designed to create aroma and a sensory draw using air only. There is no liquid to drink, no flavour to consume, no smoke, no vapour, no heating, and nothing is designed to be ingested.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WzqzzN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Brisa help with the habit?",
            "answer": "<p>Brisa is designed for the \u201cmoment\u201d, especially when you are trying to move away from smoking or vaping and the urge hits.</p><p>Instead of going back to nicotine, you use Brisa as the replacement action. It is designed as closely as possible to mimic the old habit, with a familiar weight, size, look, aroma, hand-to-mouth feel, and draw pressure, but without smoke, vapour, or nicotine.</p><p>If you use Brisa every time the urge hits, you are replacing the nicotine routine with a smoke-free, vapour-free, nicotine-free tool.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RxQPLt": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Brisa safe?",
            "answer": "<p>Brisa is a non-consumption product. There is no smoke, no vapour, no nicotine, no heating, no battery, and no e-liquid.</p><p>It works through air pressure and aroma only. You breathe air through the aromatic core to create the sensory draw, without burning, vaporising, or consuming anything.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_nPfaLW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the 30 - day success guarantee?",
            "answer": "<p>The 30-Day Success Guarantee is built around helping customers get the best result from Brisa.</p><p>After seeing over 1,000 people leave the old habit behind using Brisa, we have learned what works best for our customers. If you need extra support within your first 30 days, we will book a 1-on-1 call, talk through your current routine, and help build a better strategy using what we know.</p><p>We will also send you 3 packs of Better Cores for free to help kick-start the new strategy, valued at $45.</p><p>To claim it, contact us through our contact section with your name, phone number or WhatsApp, and the message: \u201c30 DAY SUCCESS GUARANTEE\u201d.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_ezbiVT": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do refills work?",
            "answer": "<p>The Brisa device is a one-time purchase. Once you own the unit, you only replace the cores.</p><p>The Starter Kit already comes with 30 days worth of cores. After that, you simply order refill core packs and replace the core when the aroma starts to fade.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_px4ApX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the mates pack?",
            "answer": "<p>The Mates Pack is made for sharing Brisa with someone else.</p><p>It includes multiple starter kits so you and a mate can start together, support each other, and both have your own device and cores. It is the best option if two people want to start the Brisa routine at the same time.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
